&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Viral Nation, compensation is structured, performance-led, and market-aligned. Pay decisions are intentional, based on role requirements, performance, and market alignment by country, and are set to maintain internal pay equity across comparable roles and levels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compensation progression is tied to demonstrated performance, expanded scope, and sustained contribution over time, not tenure alone. Employee compensation is reviewed regularly through formal performance reviews and check-ins to ensure alignment with role expectations and impact.&lt;/div&gt;
