&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with sales, product development, and other teams to ensure alignment of marketing strategies with overall business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Oversee the planning and execution of marketing campaigns across various channels, including email marketing, social media, website etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop and implement a comprehensive marketing strategy aligned with the company&#39;s overall objectives. Conduct market research to identify trends, opportunities, and challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
